Package: dev.rtrdd.toprow
Name: TopRow
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: A number & symbol row for the stock keyboard
 Adds a fifth row to the stock iOS keyboard: 1-0 on letters, !@#$%^&*() with
 shift or caps lock, and an extra symbol row on 123. Every row is editable,
 with key height, bottom area, landscape, per-app and per-keyboard-type
 options, all applied live. iPhone only. Free and open source.
